msgid "Confirm withdrawal"
msgstr "Widerruf bestätigen"

#: pretix_withdrawal/signals.py:144
msgid "Please fill out the form below to withdraw from your order."
msgstr ""
"Bitte füllen Sie das untenstehende Formular aus, um Ihren Vertrag zu "
"widerrufen."

#: pretix_withdrawal/signals.py:152
msgid ""
"Do you want to withdraw part of your order? Please specify here which items "
"you want to cancel."
msgstr ""
"Wollen Sie nur einen Teil Ihrer Bestellung widerrufen? Bitte geben Sie hier "
"an, welche Positionen Sie widerrufen möchten."

#: pretix_withdrawal/signals.py:162
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"We received your withdrawal. We will send an email to {email} to acknowledge "
"the receipt. The review of your withdrawal’s legal validity and scope will "
"be conducted in a separate step by our customer service team. We will get "
"back to you shortly."
msgstr ""
"Wir haben Ihre Widerrufserklärung erhalten. Wir senden eine E-Mail an "
"{email}, um den Eingang Ihres Widerrufs zu bestätigen. Die Prüfung der "
"rechtlichen Wirksamkeit und Reichweite Ihres Widerrufs erfolgt in einem "
"separaten Schritt durch unseren Kundenservice. Wir werden uns in Kürze bei "
"Ihnen melden."

#: pretix_withdrawal/signals.py:172
msgid "Your withdrawal"
msgstr "Ihr Widerruf"

#: pretix_withdrawal/signals.py:179
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"we received your declaration of revocation.\n"
"\n"
"- Date and time: {created}\n"
"- Name: {name}\n"
"- Order: {code}\n"
"\n"
"Your right of withdrawal is currently being reviewed. Please note that this "
"email\n"
"merely confirms receipt of your declaration. The review of its legal "
"validity and\n"
"scope will be conducted in a separate step by our customer service team.\n"
"We will get back to you shortly.  \n"
"\n"
"Best regards,  \n"
"Your {organizer} team"
msgstr ""
"Guten Tag,\n"
"\n"
"vielen Dank für Ihre Widerrufserklärung.\n"
"\n"
"- Datum und Uhrzeit: {created}\n"
"- Name: {name}\n"
"- Bestellung: {code}\n"
"\n"
"Ihr Widerrufsrecht wird derzeit geprüft. Bitte beachten Sie, dass diese E "
"-Mail lediglich den\n"
"Eingang Ihrer Erklärung bestätigt. Die Prüfung der rechtlichen Wirksamkeit "
"und Reichweite\n"
"erfolgt in einem separaten Schritt durch unseren Kundenservice. Wir werden "
"uns in Kürze\n"
"erneut bei Ihnen melden.\n"
"\n"
"Viele Grüße,  \n"
"Das {organizer} Team"

#: pretix_withdrawal/signals.py:198
msgid "We received a withdrawal for your order"
msgstr "Wir haben einen Widerruf für Ihre Bestellung erhalten"

#: pretix_withdrawal/signals.py:206
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"we received a withdrawal from order {code} for {event} from an email address "
"different to the one used in your order.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not initiate this withdrawal please contact us immediately.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,  \n"
"Your {organizer} team"
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"wir haben einen Widerruf für Ihre Bestellung {code} in der Veranstaltung "
"{event} von einer abweichenden E-Mail-Adresse erhalten.\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Sie diesen Widerruf nicht veranlasst haben, kontaktieren Sie uns bitte "
"umgehend.\n"
"\n"
"Viele Grüße,  \n"
"Das {organizer} Team"

